  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund for the strengthening of the Integral System of Truth, Justice, Reparation and Non-Repetition (SIVJRNR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Taking into account the challenges posed by the implementation of point 5 - &#x201c;Agreement on the Victims of the Conflict: Integral System of Truth, Justice, Reparation and Non-Repetition (SIVJRNR), including the Special Jurisdiction for Peace; and Commitment on Human Rights&#x201d; of the Agreements of Havana, for the implementation of a stable and lasting peace, as well as the defined lines for the support of Sweden in the construction of peace in Colombia, the present project will have as a general purpose to contribute to the implementation of the SIVJRNR and promote the participation of the victims in the process. The project will be implemented through three components that include institutional strengthening, promotion and access to information, and the development of confidence-building measures.</narrative>
  </description>
